The Ministry of Public Works will close the application for a ship agent license by July 29.
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) on the afternoon of May 2, 2022 issued a notification on the deadline for applying for a ship agency license and announced the closure of the application for an agency license. Ship by July 29, 2022.
According to the ministry's announcement, the ministry has confirmed that after the prakas on the procedure for granting licenses to shipping agencies came into force, some ship agents have not yet applied for licenses to become agents. The ship is still legal.
The Ministry of Public Works and Transport would like to remind all shipping agency companies to apply for a ship agency license by July 29, 2022, before the Port EDI system is officially launched.
In the event that a ship agent does not apply for a permit, the company will not be eligible for a Port EDI account to be used for port entry and exit procedures.
