Speaking to Fresh News on the afternoon of May 2, 2022, Duke Lim Heng, Vice President of the Cambodian Chamber of Commerce, said that the receipt of 52 new investment projects with a total investment of about 2,500 million dollars is a good sign. For foreign direct investment as well as the registration of local companies on investment projects in Cambodia increases.
Oknha Lim Heng emphasized that this increase is due to the successful strategy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, on vaccination and economic recovery, making all sectors work and easing access restrictions. Come to Cambodia too.
