On this occasion, Mr. Nou Peng Chandara praised the past efforts of the former Chief of Kandal Provincial Tax Branch, who achieved almost 400% of the tax collection plan, which is a good achievement and A good example for all civil servants to work hard and collect more taxes into the state.
