In this program, Mr. Nuth Vutha thanked the management for giving him the opportunity to be promoted to Deputy Director of the Department of Small and Medium Taxpayers of the General Department of Taxation, which is an opportunity for him to To serve the people and the nation, to participate in the collection of taxes to the state as desired by the Royal Government of Cambodia.
