(Phnom Penh): As the 5th Mandate Commune / Sangkat Council Election Approaches, Full Candidates, Reserve Candidates and Candlelight Party Activists Separate and Join the CPP Like a Dam . In particular, the first, second and third candidates and many reserve candidates have agreed to leave the Candlelight Party to reunite with the ruling party.
May 1, 2022 is like a storm blowing on the Candlelight Party because separatist movements have occurred almost all over the country. Full candidates and reserve candidates of the Sam Rainsy Party have left in large numbers to join the ruling party of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
In fact, in Phnom Penh alone, 78 commune council candidates and candlelight activists have announced their intention to join the CPP. Of these, 52 are full and reserve candidates, while 26 are commune activists.
