In Kampong Chhnang province, 136 activists from the Candlelight Party and former CNRP also announced their intention to join the CPP. Apart from Phnom Penh, Kampot and Kampong Chhnang, in other provinces, activities leaving the former CNRP and the Candlelight Party are also taking place. It has been months since the candlelight vigil, but now it is exploding.
Why did activists and candidates for the Commune / Sangkat Council of the Candlelight Party announce to live with the CPP? The reasons for the Candlelight Party Candidates to leave the commune are as follows:
First, because they know very well that the Candlelight Party is the successor of three generations of traitorous politicians, who in the past used to ridicule others, dare to form a new political party as a puppet party, a puppet party, a tamarind party. Later, he ordered his comrades to join the Candlelight Party, which was the original party, before joining the Human Rights Party by betraying the will of the activists. Therefore, those activists and candidates also lost faith in this party.
According to information from the provinces, the movement to leave the Candlelight Party and join the CPP is continuing to flourish more than ever.
The movement is also creating a hurricane blowing on the candle with the force of the wind coming from its interior without anyone else going out to extinguish the candle. Former opposition activists and activists who have now been tricked into joining the Candlelight Party are also joining forces to end the life of a traitorous politician.
