(Tbong Khmum): On the afternoon of April 30, 2022, Dr. Osman Hassan, Senior Minister in charge of Special Mission and Chairman of the Cambodian Muslim Development Fund, presided over a visit and distribution of donations from IHO Ebrar. Turkish people living in Germany through the Cambodian Muslim Development Foundation to 100 families in Soy 1 village, Peus 1 commune, Krouch Chhmar district, Tbong Khmum province.
On that occasion, Senior Minister Osman Hassan thanked the Turkish philanthropists in Germany for their efforts to take care of and provide assistance to the needy Cambodians, regardless of race or religion.
