South Africa reported the highest number of cases and deaths in Africa and just recovered from the fourth wave in January, while the fifth wave is likely to occur in May or June. .
According to the South African Health Authority, although hospitalizations are on the rise, so far the situation has not led to a shortage of nursing or mortuary rooms. Receive any reports of new strains of viruses other than Omega virus.
