Sixth, continue to improve health and hygiene in educational institutions by continuing to implement the "3 do not and 3 prevent" approach and participate in preventing the entry into educational institutions, including increasing education on safety, health, education, gaps, safety and food safety for education staff and Students. Continue to care for the mental and physical health of students directly or indirectly affected by Kovid 19.
