BEIJING, April 26 (Xinhua) - Xi Jinping, secretary-general of the CPC Central Committee, chairman of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China (CPC) and chairman of the CPC Central Committee and chairman of the CPC Central Committee, chaired a meeting of the CPC Central Committee on April 26. 11th Central China Finance and Economy Forum to discuss comprehensive infrastructure development
Xi Jinping stressed that infrastructure is an important support for economic and social development, so it is necessary to strengthen the construction of infrastructure in all aspects, build a modern infrastructure system to be a solid foundation for building a modern socialist country in all aspects. .
The meeting stressed the need to strengthen the construction of network infrastructure in the areas of transportation, energy and irrigation, and focus on network connectivity, complement the network and strengthen the chain in building efforts to increase network efficiency. Increase support for assurances for infrastructure construction. Coordinating development and security are two key issues.
