Dr. Koy Pisey, Deputy Director of the Permanent Secretariat of the National Authority for Border Affairs, confirmed to Fresh News on the occasion that Mr. Var Kimhong praised and highly appreciated the activities of road construction and border infrastructure, even though Cambodia is in the context of Kovid-19 However, the construction to date has achieved a lot of proud results.
