On that occasion, the Maldives Ambassador also commended the Government of Cambodia under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen in controlling the epidemic situation of Kovid 19, especially the vaccination campaign, as well as Cambodia's important role as ASEAN Chair. Shifts as well as roles in the region.
