"But in order to ensure the resilience of the mask wearer and the absence of contagious diseases, I, on the second point, call on our people to adopt the third dose, which is considered the minimum dose. "The lowest in our country where you have given two doses is to continue to give a third dose." This is according to Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Samdech added that in order to avoid any confusion, even though Samdech used to wear the "third dose is mandatory", this case will not be the implementation of legal or administrative measures, as this injection is based on voluntary principles. Mind.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that after the waiver of the duty to wear a mask, Samdech still encourages people to take a quick test in case of doubt and put themselves in isolation and treatment. "After removing the obligation to wear a mask, we must closely monitor the points that may occur and the Royal Government must adopt a management approach through the re-wearing of the mask across the country or Which part? ”
