Samrong City Police and Oddar Meanchey Provincial Criminal Police Receive Incentives from Leaders in Operation to Crack Down on Rape and Killing of a Woman
The General Commissioner confirmed that the criminal police force received 2,000,000 Riels and the Samrong Police Inspectorate received 2,000,000 Riels. Break the above case and encourage the efforts to continue to strengthen the work skills to maintain better security and social order.
It should be noted that Mr. Yin Viseth, Investigating Judge of Oddar Meanchey Provincial Court, on April 22, 2022, decided to detain 3 perpetrators in the case of rape and murder of a female victim at the mouth of O Street 11, Village Chamkar Chek, Sangkat O Smach, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province on April 15, 2022.
Under the direction of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, under the coordination of Mr. Touch Sopheakdey, Prosecutor of the Provincial Court, Major General Huot Sothy, Provincial Police Commissioner, on April 18, 2022, led the professional force of Samrong City Police Inspectorate, in cooperation with the Criminal Police Planning Task Force of the Provincial Commission, successfully investigated and separated the murder case in Sangkat O Smach, Samrong City.
The report of the Provincial Police Commission, obtained by Fresh News on April 19, 2022, states that in the above operation, the specialized force investigated and identified and arrested two suspects. The names are as follows:
* First, Pheak Seiha, 18 years old, resides in Opok Village, Sangkat Kon Kreal, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province * Second: Pheach Socheat, 17 years old, resides in Aphivath Village, Sangkat O Smach, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province.
After questioning the two perpetrators, they admitted that another member of their party had joined the rape. Then, until 2:00 on the 19th, the specialized force also arrested another suspect named 15-year-old Tray Chetra in Aphivath Village, Sangkat O Smach, Samrong City, Oddar Meanchey Province.
Later, when the specialized forces interrogated the three suspects, they confessed that they had actually ambushed the victims on the street to rape them. Beaten to death and thrown into a stream south of the village.
On April 15, 2022, at around 23:00, at the mouth of the stream south of the village in Kar Chek village, Sangkat O Smach, Samrong city, Oddar Meanchey province, a case of rape and murder caused by an unidentified suspect was arrested. The victim, Long Kimlay, a 17-year-old female resident of the village, raped and beat her to death and threw her body into a stream south of Chamkar Chek village.
