The 4th Asia-Pacific Water Summit was held under the theme "Water for Sustainable Development: Empowerment and Succession". Samdech Techo Hun Sen will deliver a keynote address at the Summit, focusing on the importance of water and water-related issues, as well as the need to work together to manage this vital resource sustainably.
