Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the Prime Minister to prepare important documents to discuss border issues between the two countries during his visit to Laos. Samdech Techo Hun Sen also expressed satisfaction with the invitation of Lt. Gen. Hun Manet to visit Laos to strengthen military ties and cooperation between the two countries.
According to Dr. Kao Kim Hourn, in this meeting, the Prime Minister of Laos also informed Samdech Techo that he plans to visit the provinces bordering Cambodia, such as Champasak. The visit aims to strengthen ties between those provinces and Cambodia's bordering provinces. The Lao Prime Minister also stated that during his visit to those provinces, he would inform the policies and positions between the two governments.
To strengthen border ties, the Lao Prime Minister also wants the construction of a bridge connecting the provinces bordering the two countries. Samdech Techo Hun Sen considers this a good thing, but waits for the border issue between the two countries to be resolved.
