Two villages in Banteay Srei district will have two more concrete roads built on the old dam
(Siem Reap): The governor of Banteay Srei district presented the good news to the villagers of Thnal Pnoy and Thnal Toteung villages after the APSARA Authority allowed the construction of two concrete roads on the back of the old dam and after more than two years of request.
