For the concrete road achievement that will take shape by the end of 2022, Finan hopes that the greenery on the road, which used to be dull and unattractive soil, will return to its original natural beauty. On the other hand, the courtyard in front of the house, which is always very dusty and difficult to breathe, will be turned into a gathering place for children to run and play, and the villagers sell food and drink like Preah Dak village.
Mr. Finang also thanked the APSARA Authority for granting permission on the request of the Banteay Srei District Administration to pave the way for the construction of the concrete road to proceed. The two concrete roads will be launched soon and will be completed in 2022, with a combined development budget from the commune, district and Tonle Sap funds.
