(Prey Veng): A traffic accident occurred when a bus of Vireak Bun Tham Company overturned, causing a fire at 3: 5 am on April 21, 2022 at Krasaing Koy village, Chrey commune, Svay Antor district, Prey Veng province. National Road No. 8.
A total of seven people were slightly injured in the accident. Before the accident, the car was driving from west to east. When it reached the scene above, suddenly the wheel overturned and fell on the right side of the road, causing a huge fire. Authorities intervened to help put out the fire, but could not control the situation, causing the car of Vireak Buntham to burn.
