The joy of the Cambodian people and youth comes as the world continues to be plagued by the global Kovid-19 epidemic. On the contrary, the Cambodian people and youth can celebrate their New Year very happily.
There are four main reasons why Cambodians and young people know this kind of happiness: Peace, which is the most necessary and important factor to ensure that Cambodian people and youth can know happiness without worrying about war or insecurity Not personal.
Unlike previous generations, their childhood and adolescence were ruined by war and genocide, leaving their lives in fear, starvation, and death at all times by shelling, slaughter, and broken labor. Strength or starvation due to starvation. But young people today never worry about all that.
They only think of getting a higher degree, living a decent and dignified life in a society rich in food and modern technology that their seniors have never known in the last 500 years of history.
In the last 500 years of history, there has never been a time when Cambodia has experienced as much development as it does today. In the last 500 years of history, there has never been a time when Cambodia has experienced the development of transport and tourism infrastructure as it is today, and there has never been a time when the Cambodian people and youth have been as rich as they are today. .
