Implementing the system, which is a new technology tool of the Royal Government now to connect and transmit advance passenger data and passenger name records from national and international airlines flying in and out of Cambodia to the GTAS system through the exchange nursery Cambodia data that competent institutions can use to analyze risks according to their respective roles and responsibilities.
