The meeting was attended by representatives from the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts, the Ministry of Interior, the Ministry of National Defense, the Ministry of Economy and Finance, the Ministry of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, the Ministry of Agriculture, the Ministry of Mines and Energy, the Ministry of Tourism and the Prey Veng Provincial Administrative Representative. The meeting was held at the Ministry of Environment.
