The meeting agreed for the inter-ministerial working group and relevant institutions to conduct a final study on the actual location and determine the management area, as well as to address the impacts before the Ministry of Environment and the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts request a decision from the head of the Royal Government on the establishment of natural heritage sites. And culture, history, Nokor Phnom-Cheu Kach Ba Phnom.
