The practice exam is the second day after the 60-minute theory exam on April 19, 2022. In the process of this practice exam, there are 10 participants who have been trained for the past two months on 36 dishes, including European, Asian and Italian dishes, which are divided into two courses.
In the first session, participants have to prepare 2 dishes (hot and cold) to submit to the evaluation and feedback committee. In the second session, participants will present the food they have prepared and present the meaning of their food to the evaluation committee.
It should be noted that, in addition to training for master's and doctoral degrees, the Royal Academy of Cambodia also provides technical and vocational training for chefs, cocktails, fruit smoothies and coffee makers.
