(Siem Reap): A man in Puok district who fell into a crocodile pool at his home has now died after being taken to hospital, but due to serious injuries, doctors were unable to save his life.
Puok District Inspector Tep Pum Sen said this morning, April 20, 2022, that the victim, Sou Sothea, a 37-year-old male resident of Kampong Tayong Village, Puok Commune, Puok District, Siem Reap Province, died while traveling. Return home in Santuk district, Kampong Thom province at 3:30 on April 19, 2022. He said that the body was prepared by the family to celebrate at home according to tradition.
The victim, the owner of the crocodile above, slipped and fell into the crocodile pool in the middle of the night on April 18 while getting up to urinate. The victim, a Puok district administration official, was severely injured by his crocodile and was rushed to hospital by neighbors. Due to his serious condition, his family sent him to Calmette Hospital for treatment, but his condition worsened and he died on the way home in Kampong Thom province.
