At 7:45 a.m. on April 19, 2022, a group of more than 200 workers out of more than 300 went on strike to find a solution, causing traffic jams in the streets. Choam Chao in front of the factory above is located in Trapeang Thleung 3 Village, Sangkat Choam Chao I, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh for almost an hour until the authorities coordinate.
According to the workers, on April 6, 2022, an eight-point agreement was signed between the workers' representatives and the "Canterver Cambodia Cambodia" company, represented by a lawyer. After that, the workers went to work normally until the traditional Khmer New Year holiday, and the factory allowed them to stop for three days until April 18 before returning to work.
