Commentary: Higher level of openness and making the world share more opportunities with China
(Beijing): The door for China's opening will not close, will open more and more. This is China's solemn and solemn promise to the world. Over the past four years, the construction and development of the Hainan Free Trade Port has become a model for China to honor its promises.
On the same day, according to data released by the General Administration of Customs, Hainan's total export-import trade volume increased from 70.280 billion yuan in 2017 to 147.680 million yuan in 2017. In 2021, the average annual growth rate will increase by 20.4 percent, the average annual growth rate will be 11.5 percent faster than the whole of China, which ranks second.
In fact, the world has benefited from the construction of the Hainan Free Trade Port in the past four years. For example, duty-free policies have also benefited many enterprises. By the end of March 2022, after the duty-free policy of Hainan Free Trade Port, the total import volume exceeded 7 billion yuan, covering all kinds of products such as boats, cars, planes and production equipment.
As the Regional Comprehensive Economic Partnership (RCE) Agreement enters into force on January 1, 2022, Hainan Free Trade Port receives new development opportunities. It is predictable that from Hainan to the whole of China, a new round of high-level opening will make the world share more of China's opportunities, as well as provide an immediate impetus to the global economic recovery. He too.
