(Phnom Penh): In the dry season, people in the western part of Phnom Penh often face the problem of lack of clean water due to low water pressure and increasing water consumption.
As promised by the Director General of Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority in the conference on the progress of the commune / sangkat of Phnom Penh Capital Administration in early March 2022, before the Khmer New Year 2022, Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority will try Increase the pressure of clean water supply in the western part of Phnom Penh so that the people in Kambol district have enough water to use.
The gift from the Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority to the people in this district has made the people very happy that their problems are always solved in the dry season.
From March 1, 2022, Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority (PPWSA) has implemented the project to install 800 mm and 600 mm additional water mains on National Road No. 4 from Victory Boulevard to Economic Zone. Especially in Phnom Penh and the top area, by urging the professional team to work hard to speed up the implementation of the work to install the pipeline 24 hours / 24 hours.
On April 9, 2022, the installation of water mains was completed and water supply was opened to the upper area, allowing the people living in that area to have enough water.
Mr. Som Sovann, Director of Business Department of Phnom Penh Water Supply Authority, said that after connecting the water mains, the water pressure in Kambol district has now increased to 10 meters, while in the past there was almost no running water. No, especially in the New World Borey.
He said that from now on, the area will not face a shortage of clean water.
