Under the strict order of Samdech Techo with the prompt action of doctors and relevant authorities at all levels, so far Cambodia has achieved vaccination of people from the age of 3 years more than 92% of the population. Citizens across the country. As of April 10, Cambodia has injected nearly 15 million people in the first dose, more than 14 million in the second dose, more than 8 million in the third dose and more than 1 million in the fourth dose.
