Experts continue to find dried boracic chemicals and some defective goods at Veal Yun Market, Svay Rieng Province
(Svay Rieng): On the occasion of the upcoming New Year, Branch Officers of Consumer Protection, Competition and Fraud Suppression of Svay Rieng Branch cooperated with Provincial Department of Commerce and local authorities to inspect All kinds of goods at Veal Yun Market, Svay Rieng City, Svay Rieng Province.
Mr. Phat Savuth, Branch Manager of Svay Rieng Province, said that on the morning of April 11, 2022, professional officers inspected many goods during the upcoming New Year. Inspect goods that contain chemicals that affect people's health.
As a result, he inspected 4.3 kilograms of dried trout containing boracic acid and a can of condensed milk and 18 bottles of fake alcohol, he said. Defective goods are subject to confiscation and penalties in accordance with legal procedures. All these goods were confiscated, stored, burned, destroyed and fined in accordance with legal procedures. The fake Bicheng logo is not available in the market.
