Decision to delete the list of candidates for the Candlelight Party in 11 communes / sangkats, including: Phnom Penh 8 communes, Kampong Cham 2 communes and Pursat 1 commune.
A spokesman for the NEC stated: "The Candlelight Party claims that it has harmed its party officials, which is related to the jurisdiction of many local authorities. "The court summoned Anong is a separate matter for individuals, not within the jurisdiction of the NEC, so the NEC keeps deleting the list."
According to the spokesman, most of the 86 candidates who were removed were from the Candlelight Party, which were all low-quality candidates who had been sued. In addition, other candidates from the Beehive Social Democratic Party And the Khmer Will Party.
Pursuant to Article 58 of the Law on Commune / Sangkat Council Election, in the event that a citizen complains about the delisting of a candidate, if the Trial Chamber finds that the candidate is not in accordance with the law, the Trial Chamber will issue a statement. Decided to delete the name of that candidate in accordance with Articles 35 and 42 of the Law on Commune / Sangkat Council Election.
The Trial Chamber of the NEC shall hold a public hearing by the plaintiffs, the plaintiffs, the lawyers, the plaintiffs, the defendants, the lawyers, the defendants and the witnesses, the plaintiffs or the defendants, and the examination of the facts and figures. Law.
The NEC Trial Chamber found many irregularities of the Candlelight Party in preparing the documents of the candidates and the list of candidates for election by improperly implementing the spirit of Article 35, Article 42, Article 59 of the Law on Candidates. Election of Commune / Sangkat Councils, which demonstrates the Lack of Accountability of the Candlelight Party.
Based on the strong legal basis as stated in the Law on Commune / Sangkat Council Election, the NEC Trial Chamber decided to delete the names of candidates and some candidate lists of the Candlelight Party and the decision of the NEC. As a final decision, close the way to protest.
It should be noted that at least 17 parties competed in the 5th Commune / Sangkat Council Election in June, in which the CPP has nominated 28,008 candidates in 1 Commune / Sangkat. 652 people nationwide. The Candlelight Party fielded 1,620 candidates in communes / sangkats. FUNCINPEC fielded 715 candidates in 7 communes / sangkats, Mr. Nhek Bun Chhay's Khmer United National Party put 650 candidates in 6 communes / sangkats.
