Mr. Hun Manet clarified the three meanings that led him to participate in the Ramadan meal with Khmer Muslims
(Phnom Penh): Lieutenant General Hun Manet, Deputy Commander of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander of the Land Forces, presided over the dinner of Ramadan 2022 with leaders on the evening of April 10, 2022. And Cambodian Khmer Muslims.
