1: The Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training is responsible for organizing this National Day by properly implementing health measures. At the same time, it is necessary to produce videos and other documents in collaboration with relevant ministries, institutions, provincial and municipal administrations, national and international organizations, development partners and the private sector to disseminate widely throughout the country.
4. Each provincial administration shall organize the 5th National Technical and Vocational Education and Training Day 2022 with the participation of the Department of Labor and Vocational Training, public and private technical and vocational education and training institutions and associations in the territory of Body. At the same time, there must be a movement to encourage the participation of the private sector, companies, factories, enterprises and institutions.
5: The Ministry of Information must introduce the public and private media and social media, including radio, television, newspapers and other media to disseminate the circular, message of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, videos and other documents on the occasion of the day. This nation.
The Royal Government would like to call on professors, teachers, students, parents, guardians, workers, employers, NGOs, development partners and all compatriots to join and promote this National Day to be celebrated throughout the country.
