(Kampong Thom): The Honorary Minister of the National Assembly-Senate Relations and Inspection, Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, presided over the inauguration ceremony of a concrete bridge across the Stung Sen River in Kampong Svay Village, Kampong Svay Commune, Kampong Svay District, Kampong Thom Province this morning. This April 2022.
Speaking on the occasion, Ms. Men Sam An stated that under the skillful and wise leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, who is a unique guide and a victorious political operator who has brought peace to the motherland of Cambodia. Towards the development of all sectors, focusing on four priorities: roads, people, water, electricity.
Today, the achievement of this new concrete bridge also shows the faith and unity that comes from the peace factor, which allowed all of you to participate in building the achievements that were inaugurated today and have contributed to promote development.
The concrete bridge is 151.2 meters long and 6.50 meters wide. Citizens, businessmen, government officials, the army and philanthropists have agreed to start construction in 2018 and complete it in 2021 at a cost of nearly 630,000 dollars.
