Minister of Education: Investment in education as an extension of knowledge to contribute to national development
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Hang Chuon Naron, Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, stated that investment in education is an investment to change the face of Cambodia in the future and an investment in national economic security to expand. Practical knowledge that can help students earn a living, support their families, and support the community.
This morning, April 9, 2022, Dr. Hang Chuon Naron said this at the graduation ceremony for the winners of the Qualification Promotion Program of the First and Second Generation School Management Committee and the Qualification Promotion Program. More than 300 second and third generation teachers.
The Minister of Education also claimed that through the many curriculum reform projects for teachers, it has changed the image of the school and created a favorable environment in the school so that students can get real knowledge and knowledge in the subject. Knowledge on income generation and extended knowledge to the community on improving the school as a whole.
Mr. Hang Chuon Naron continued that around the study in the situation of the 19 epidemic of Kovid, teachers and school administrators have played an important role and turned this Kovid crisis into an opportunity to use technology. On teaching and learning of students.
Dr. Hang Chuon Naron also stated that teachers who do not participate in this project will be able to benefit from this project to help improve teaching methods and share good experiences in The goal for students to learn and gain real knowledge. In addition, school administrators and teachers also played an important role in turning the Kovid crisis into an opportunity for the use of technology in teaching.
(Sihanoukville): While the Royal Government claims that "Cambodia is a safe and warm tourist destination", the Ministry of Tourism also assessed that "Sihanoukville is also a quality, safe and warm tourist destination". In Cambodia, national and international tourists can visit and relax safely and comfortably.
In order to promote these tourism destinations more widely, Mr. Ny Phally, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism, on behalf of Minister Thong Khon, together with representatives of Preah Sihanouk Provincial Administration, Provincial Department of Tourism, specialized units around the province, as well as coastal tourism operators in Sihanoukville. Dissemination ceremony on supporting Sihanoukville as a tourist destination, quality, safety and warmth on the morning of April 8, 2022.
Under Secretary of State Ny Phally emphasized that "peace is the foundation and the determining factor for the prosperity of tourism development." The protocol also received the full support of the protocol as all parties pledged together to continue to participate in peacekeeping.
At the same time, the Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism instructed the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration, which has specialized departments and units, to continue its active efforts to disseminate, educate and encourage tourism businesses to implement tourism safety rules and minimum operating standards. SOP) and sustainable health measures aimed at enhancing the prestige of Sihanoukville as a safe tourism destination.
He said that if the ministries and institutions of the Sihanoukville Provincial Administration, the provincial tourism department, specialized units around the province, as well as tour operators and tour operators cooperate to implement this work better, it will help attract more tourists to visit and relax in Sihanoukville. Increase as well as increase the confidence of tourists and the general public.
