(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Municipal Police on the afternoon of April 08, 2022, came out to reject the fabrication of information related to the motorcycle robbery case on Street 430 behind the Russian Hospital, which confuses people online. Facebook society.
Police confirmed that after receiving information from the Information and Quick Reaction Team of the Phnom Penh Municipal Police, Colonel Som Piseth, Boeung Keng Kang District Police Inspector, ordered the Dam Administration Police and the Criminal Police Force of the Boeung Keng Kang District Police Inspectorate to investigate. Arrived at the scene to watch the security camera and the testimony of two witnesses at the scene as vendors along Street 430.
As a result, it was confirmed that it was not a robbery, just a motorcycle crash on their own, and they helped lift and take the victim to the hospital for treatment.
