* The NEC Trial Chamber found many irregularities of the Candlelight Party in preparing the documents of the candidates and the list of candidates for election by improperly implementing the spirit of Article 35, Article 42, Article 59 of the Law. The Commune / Sangkat Council Election, which underscores the Candlelight Party's lack of responsibility.
