Government Spokesperson Unit Holds a Workshop on Information Bureau and Information Governance in Kandal Province
(Kandal): On the morning of April 4, 2022, the Royal Government Spokesperson Unit held a two-day seminar on the Office of Information Intelligence and Good Governance in the Information Sector at Kandal Provincial Hall. Attended by Mr. and Mrs. as the spokesperson of the provincial hall and the director of the specialized units around 6 provincial capitals: Phnom Penh, Kandal, Takeo, Kampong Speu, Kampong Chhnang and Preah Vihear.
Mr. Phay Siphan, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Royal Government Spokesperson Unit, stated that the purpose of this workshop was to share the basic ideas, mechanisms and strategies of the state information sector in order to build good governance. In the field of information at the sub-national level to promote the effectiveness of disseminating information to bring people closer for the direct benefit at the local level.
He added that this activity is a practical implementation of the spirit and content of the inter-ministerial prakas between the Ministry of Interior and the Ministry of Information on "Roles and Duties of the Capital-Provincial Information Officer" dated July 26, 2012.
Mr. Phay Siphan added that over the past decade (10 years), Cambodia has made unparalleled history with the highest meaning: the empowerment of the people under the action and the theme of "sub-national democracy" with a mechanism. With lively potential is the OWSO and Citizens' Office.
