(Phnom Penh): Mr. Ley Sopheap, President of the Federation of Investors of Cambodia and President of the Federation of Network Marketing Business of Cambodia, continued to call on all members and network marketing business people in Cambodia to unite to maintain the right profession, not to lose confidence forever. Make network marketing black and dirty.
