On that occasion, Mr. Thu Sun added that the National Center must be set up as an effective standard center for medical treatment, rehabilitation, physical and mental health, vocational training, real skills, long-term and Short and give you a job here to give confidence to parents, guardians, as well as the wishes of the leadership, especially Deputy Prime Minister Ke Kim Yan, President of the National Authority for Combating Drugs.
Mr. Thou Sun urged all participants to work hard to gain knowledge from this training, strengthen their ability to work effectively.
Please note that this training program will run for 4 days from 4 to 7 April 2022.
