Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the inauguration of 38 roads in Siem Reap
On the occasion of the inauguration of 38 roads in Siem Reap, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than 1 hour and 20 minutes. The following is the main content:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 could not hinder the development of Cambodian society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended the Inter-Ministerial Commission for its efforts to build all 38 roads in Siem Reap into real achievements.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all 38 roads are adopted by Cambodia, built by Cambodian children and the national budget itself.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was really happy with this new achievement and re-declared that this achievement is a star of the North.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is really proud of this achievement because it did not happen easily.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the construction team, most of which are Cambodia's young resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that these 38 roads are named after the King, the former King and the Cambodian dignitaries who have built works and achievements for the nation. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that these roads did not have the names of Lon Nol, Sirik Matak, Cheng Heng and Son Ngoc Thanh, who were traitors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that peace has given Cambodia the opportunity to build all kinds of achievements.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of roads and the improvement of the Siem Reap River could not cut off the participation of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some people affected by the infrastructure construction project in Siem Reap were willing to go to the pagoda and hand over the land to the authorities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen highly respected and appreciated the dedication and participation of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the national team and the Siem Reap provincial authorities to take care of the people who have to move from the construction site of the infrastructure and improve the Siem Reap River and live in the development village of Techo Run Ta Ek.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy with the arrangement of the wastewater treatment system.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that when he inspected all 38 roads in the city and saw cars parked in front of people's houses, it reminded Samdech of the past of Cambodia with only bicycles parked in front of houses.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the perpetrators of obscenity and theft in Siem Reap must end because security cameras are installed in public places.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is not difficult to pour concrete along the banks and banks of the Siem Reap River, but it is not possible because it is a protected area and a UNESCO condition that Angkor Wat is inscribed on the World Heritage List.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to real estate developers who want to have high-rise buildings in Siem Reap.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if such high-rise buildings are built, Angkor Wat will be removed from the World Heritage List.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that heritage properties in some countries have been removed from the list due to violations of UNESCO conditions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told UNESCO not to worry about the implementation of the conditions for conservation in Siem Reap: Cambodia does not cut hens to be delicious for a while, instead to raise hens to grow to lay eggs for a long time Long.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that today, 52 years ago, when Samdech became a fighter in the forest at the call of Samdech Preah Borom Ratanakoth.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all the people in the temples and territory of Siem Reap province who helped control his life from the attack on September 24, 1998 and gave Samdech the opportunity to build the motherland. Currently.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that when there is peace, try to keep it, do not wait until there is a war to try to shout for peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that without peace, do not talk about development, respect for human rights and democracy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the former King and thanked the people and leaders of the Cambodian People's Party for supporting Samdech to lead the country out of the flames of war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no matter how the country is led by any political party, peace must be maintained.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that those who try to destroy the peace must not be tolerated, that is, do not be afraid to destroy those traitors
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that increasing the average annual income of the people will cause Cambodia to lose the benefits of international financial institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is considering upgrading the railway, which is an outdated railway, and is studying the construction of a link between Siem Reap and Battambang.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on people to continue to implement health measures and participate in vaccination to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Commission for Vaccination may send doctors to vaccinate in recreation areas.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces again the permission to have fun dancing during the traditional New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that opening the people to enjoy the New Year is not to bring people to experience the spread of Kovid 19, but Samdech also wants to know if this will be Is Kovid 19 contagious?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is considering allowing the wearing of masks in some provinces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the fight against Kovid 19 could not be as successful as it is today if the people did not participate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen, I would like to thank and thank you for your blessings and wishes, and I would like to wish the Cambodian nation peace.
