Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Opportunity to Inspect the Progress of Construction of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Sunday morning, April 3, 2022, inspected the progress of the construction of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport in Popel and Tayek communes, Sot Nikum district, Siem Reap province.
On the occasion of inspecting the progress of construction of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than an hour. The following are the main contents of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport project, which has continued to progress despite the context of the Kovid 19 epidemic.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is a major project signed under the presidency of Samdech and Chinese President Xi Jinping.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the need for the construction of the new airport because the current airport can not receive large aircraft.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport, which is about 40 kilometers from Angkor, is a distance to ensure the safety of the Angkor temples.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport can receive aircraft at all levels.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the airport made with France is to take a large part of the flour to combine with the French flour to make Khmer cakes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport requires some compensation to a French company that has been granted the right to invest in the airport in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that China has invested money to build an airport and 50 years later will be handed over to Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the investment in the airport between Chinese and French companies is different. The Chinese use flour to make cakes for the Khmers, while the French companies, the Khmers, produce most of the flour combined with the French flour to make cakes for the Khmers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it should not be confused that the investment in Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport benefits only China, because in the future, Cambodia will have to receive more tourists.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2012, Samdech wanted to hold the ASEAN Summit in Siem Reap, but the Siem Reap airport could not allow the large planes of the leaders of the partner countries to land.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport will promote development in this area and that it is enough for Cambodia to announce the North Star.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called the achievements of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport an effort of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction site of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is a former battlefield.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction site of Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is one of his goals in turning the war zone into a development zone.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this achievement is not a coincidence, but comes from efforts to end the war through win-win politics, bring peace and territorial unity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we must continue to jointly promote the development of the construction area of the new airport in Siem Reap, such as connecting electricity, water supply and road construction. For the road, there will be an expressway from the airport and National Road No. 6 will be widened into four lanes to enter Siem Reap.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that when the new airport in Siem Reap is completed, it will provide jobs for Cambodians, not China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has previously banned the analysis that the construction of Siem Reap Airport is not a strengthening of Chinese military capabilities in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia does not need foreign troops, only foreign tourists. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is not ignorant until the territory becomes a foreign military base unconstitutional.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs the King to take a plane and land at the new airport in Siem Reap when it opens.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructs Senior Minister Sun Chanthol to borrow Chinese funds for the construction of the access road to Siem Reap.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praised the Siem Reap provincial authorities for their efforts to facilitate the construction of the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is the fruit of peace and good cooperation between Cambodia and China.
