The Malaysian leader said after the agreement was signed at the Government House that "the Memorandum of Understanding will ensure that all safeguards and safeguards procedures to be carried out by all stakeholders are consistent. "According to the laws of both countries."
The memorandum of understanding aims to match Indonesian workers with appropriate employers as part of an initiative that also strengthens wage protection, including a grievance mechanism.
