Samdech Techo Prime Minister said this on the occasion of the inauguration of the flyover and subway Choam Chao, Phnom Penh on March 31, 2022.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated, "No one replaces the angels!" There is the village of Tevata Ruk, it is the sky, the angels have never changed. And if the annual angels are exchanged in the same annual angels. Now the CPP is a party with an angelic symbol, so please continue to vote. I would like to confirm that the candidate for prime minister in the 2023 election is Hun Sen.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia said that the preparation of Dr. Hun Manet as the candidate for the future Prime Minister of the Cambodian People's Party is a precaution to avoid any eventual problems.
Please be informed that in the past, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has also stated that for the upcoming 2023 election, Samdech is still in the position of the Prime Minister's candidate for a change of leadership, which is after the election. For the position of Prime Minister, Samdech works until he no longer wants to do, and for the preparation of people to take turns is normal for the next generation.
