Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of the inauguration of the flyover and subway Chom Chao
This new achievement in the territory of Phnom Penh, born from the shadow of peace, was officially inaugurated this morning, Thursday, March 31, 2022, under the high presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
On the occasion of the inauguration, Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a speech for more than an hour, the following are the main contents:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Chom Chao flyover and subway are another historic achievement for Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked for the understanding of the people to stop the traffic on the flyover and subway to celebrate the inauguration.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of flyovers and subways is in response to the needs of the people. If in the 70s, 80s and 90s there was no need to build flyovers and subways.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered the achievements of the Chom Chao flyover and subway to show that materialism preceded the doctrine of ideas.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen commends Phnom Penh Capital Hall and OCIC for their joint efforts to build the Chom Chao flyover and subway.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the achievements of flyovers and subways in Phnom Penh have used the policy of taking the city or raising palm leaves and packing palm sugar. This is because this achievement comes from the development budget of Koh Pich as well as other areas.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the more the population grows, the greater the demand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, the policy that Samdech set out was the need and supply of food for the people. But now there is a drastic change compared to the past, with more demand.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is considering for the Ministry of Economy and Finance to prepare additional strategies on the fuel issue, wanting to have a strategic stockpile on oil issues to meet the needs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at this time, Cambodia is building infrastructure everywhere, but in Ukraine and some countries are destroying infrastructure. In Cambodia, 52 years ago, after the March 18, 1970 coup, it was also time to destroy infrastructure.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that only when there is a war do we see the value of peace. Cambodia has seen the importance of peace since the 1970s. Samdech Techo stated that the peace factor is the starting point, if there is no peace, there is no development at all.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that respect for human rights and democracy does not depend on words, but on actions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the CPP has the symbol "angel" and Samdech is still the candidate for Prime Minister in the 2023 election.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the preparation of Dr. Hun Manet as the future Prime Minister is a precautionary measure to avoid any eventual problems.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the first three months of this year, the social situation is far different from 2021. It was a difficult time due to Kovid 19 and many measures were taken to ensure the lives of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at this time, Cambodia has up to 12 million doses of vaccine in hand. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Cambodia has enough vaccines to vaccinate people to prevent 19 diseases.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that yesterday Cambodia found 40 cases of 19 Kovid.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian economy is suffering because of the crisis of the Russia-Ukraine war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that March 30 was the happiest day for him because the tax broke the record for internal revenue by collecting $ 236 million. This March alone can earn about $ 700 million. January revenue was about 288 million, February was about 223 million, and March was about 700 million. In the first three months of 2022, the revenue was over 1,200 million.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that oil mining in Sihanoukville was in trouble but had been replaced by gold mining.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the nine months from June 21, 2021 until now, Cambodia has mined 2,275 kilograms of gold. Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that this number is only one place.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech advised to speed up the promotion of low pensioners a little faster.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth to increase the budget for low-paid people, especially veterans. Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that this was done to address the inequality of officials' pensions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen advised people to gather and enjoy the upcoming National New Year, but must continue to implement health rules, especially 3 measures and 3 protections.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed authorities at all levels to pay attention to security, order and fight against Kovid 19 during the New Year.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the festival, the authorities and law enforcement forces have no rest to see this merit.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people for their support, Samdech provided an opportunity to remove the country from the flames of war and promote the country's development.
